    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Untitled Car Game, you will drift, shoot, and explode with up to 4 friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addicting Upgrades</strong><br>Acquire over 30 Upgrades with fun and unique synergies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830240/extras/d0f15db515db08e1a352e70f8b4f3c96.poster.avif?t=1755758104\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830240/extras/d0f15db515db08e1a352e70f8b4f3c96.webm?t=1755758104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830240/extras/d0f15db515db08e1a352e70f8b4f3c96.mp4?t=1755758104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Unique Maps </strong> <br>Play on over 20 maps that encourage unique play-styles. <br> <i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830240/extras/8a24f2ae71a8fa776878e11ee5fe4133.poster.avif?t=1755758104\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830240/extras/8a24f2ae71a8fa776878e11ee5fe4133.webm?t=1755758104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830240/extras/8a24f2ae71a8fa776878e11ee5fe4133.mp4?t=1755758104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <br><strong> <br>Cosmetics </strong> <br>Customize your car with varying colors and decorations. You may suck at shooting your friends but you can still out-style them!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830240/extras/0b5e7ab99c3dbed8c17d9d74d3c675e2.poster.avif?t=1755758104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830240/extras/0b5e7ab99c3dbed8c17d9d74d3c675e2.webm?t=1755758104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830240/extras/0b5e7ab99c3dbed8c17d9d74d3c675e2.mp4?t=1755758104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
